#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`display` --- display driver"
msgstr ":mod:`display` --- 顯示器驅動程式"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`display` module exposes drivers for external displays that can be "
"attached to an OpenMV Cam. Four interfaces are supported:"
msgstr ":mod:`display` 模組提供可連接至 OpenMV Cam 的外接顯示器驅動程式。支援四種介面："

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:10
msgid ""
"SPI-attached TFTs (the smaller 16-bit displays such as the SSD1351), via "
":class:`SPIDisplay`."
msgstr "SPI 連接的 TFT（如 SSD1351 等較小的 16 位元顯示器），透過 :class:`SPIDisplay`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:12
msgid ""
"24-bit parallel RGB panels driven by the LTDC/LCD-TFT controller, via "
":class:`RGBDisplay`. The same parallel bus also feeds external HDMI / "
"DisplayPort converters (e.g. a TFP410), so HDMI and DisplayPort outputs are "
"configured through :class:`RGBDisplay` too."
msgstr ""
"由 LTDC/LCD-TFT 控制器驅動的 24 位元並列 RGB 面板，透過 :class:`RGBDisplay`\\ 。同一條並列匯流排也供給外接"
" HDMI／DisplayPort 轉換器（例如 TFP410），因此 HDMI 與 DisplayPort 輸出也是透過 "
":class:`RGBDisplay` 來設定。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:16
msgid "MIPI-DSI panels, via :class:`DSIDisplay`."
msgstr "MIPI-DSI 面板，透過 :class:`DSIDisplay`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:17
msgid "NTSC analog video on the OpenMV TV shield, via :class:`TVDisplay`."
msgstr "OpenMV TV 擴充板上的 NTSC 類比視訊，透過 :class:`TVDisplay`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:19
msgid ""
"Panel-specific initialisation lives in dedicated controller classes "
"(:class:`SSD1351` for SPI panels, :class:`ST7701` for DSI panels) that are "
"passed to the display constructor through the ``controller`` argument. "
"Backlight brightness is driven by :class:`DACBacklight` or "
":class:`PWMBacklight`, hooked in via the ``backlight`` argument."
msgstr ""
"面板專屬的初始化置於專用的控制器類別中（\\ :class:`SSD1351` 用於 SPI 面板，\\ :class:`ST7701` 用於 DSI "
"面板），並透過 ``controller`` 引數傳遞給顯示器建構子。背光亮度由 :class:`DACBacklight` 或 "
":class:`PWMBacklight` 驅動，透過 ``backlight`` 引數掛接。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:25
msgid ""
"The constants below select the output frame size and are accepted as the "
"``framesize`` argument by every display class. Once constructed a display "
"object accepts :class:`image.Image` buffers via its ``write()`` method to "
"present a frame."
msgstr ""
"下列常數用於選擇輸出影格大小，每個顯示器類別皆接受其作為 ``framesize`` 引數。建構完成後，顯示器物件透過其 ``write()`` "
"方法接受 :class:`image.Image` 緩衝區以呈現影格。"

